WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.600
An email arrives.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.360
MindGraph reads it with a local AI model

3
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.600
and spots the deadlines and appointments in it.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
That becomes a note, with a task and a link.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.800
In the evening, Brain sums up
everything you did that day.

6
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.000
Then you call it a day — MindGraph keeps at it.

7
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.900
Next morning it is all on your dashboard.
Nothing gets lost.

8
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.000
MindGraph Notes. Local and open source.
